      "trackName": "Cat Run for Apple Watch",
      "description": "Standalone Apple Watch app — “Cat Run\" Play with a raise of your wrist.\nTap to jump, dodge on-road obstacles, collect coins, and pick from multiple characters — perfect for quick breaks.\n\nFeatures & Highlights\n\nStandalone on Apple Watch: No iPhone required; play anytime, anywhere.\n\nWatch-first UI: Clear information hierarchy; buttons and numbers tuned for the watch face.\n\nParallax mountain backdrop: Near/far layers create depth without being distracting.\n\nCoins & progression: Coin system, revive mechanic, and multiple characters keep it fun.\n\nAt-a-glance stats: Best score, total runs, max consecutive jumps, total coins, and average score.\n\nDifficulty & pacing: The longer you run, the faster and trickier it gets.",
